<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Checkout cancelled — The Crawl Price Index</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Spline+Sans+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--ink:#FBFAF8;--panel:#F2EFE9;--line:#DCD7CE;--dim:#6E6A64;--fg:#14181D;--bright:#14181D;--signal:#1C5D4A}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--fg);font-family:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
  .wrap{max-width:520px;padding:40px 28px}
  .mark{font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px);font-weight:500;color:var(--bright);margin:.4em 0 .3em;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  p{color:var(--fg);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;max-width:42ch;margin:0 auto 18px}
  .btn{display:inline-block;margin:6px;font-family:"Archivo","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:11px 20px;border:1px solid var(--signal);color:var(--signal);text-decoration:none}
  .btn:hover{background:var(--signal);color:#ffffff}
  .ghost{border-color:var(--line);color:var(--dim)}
  .ghost:hover{background:transparent;color:var(--fg)}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
</head>
<body class="prose">
<div class="masthead"><div class="wrap">
  <a class="mark" href="/">The Crawl Price Index<b>.</b></a>
  <nav>
    <a class="lnk" href="/check">Check a domain</a>
    <a class="lnk" href="/world">Country editions</a>
    <a class="lnk" href="/methodology">Methodology</a>
    <a class="ghost" href="/sample">Weekly email</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/#access">Subscribe</a>
  </nav>
</div></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mark">Checkout · cancelled</div>
    <h1>No charge made.</h1>
    <p>Your checkout was cancelled and nothing was billed. The free headline numbers are always open — and Terminal is here whenever you want the full dataset and feed.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/#access">← Back to pricing</a>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/">Return to index</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
